# Extensión REST Client de VS Code. Ejecutar en orden.
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@email = ana@test.com
@password = supersecreta
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.$.id}}

### Health público
GET {{base}}/health

### Conexión de Supabase
GET {{base}}/health/db

### Sin token: 401
GET {{base}}/tasks

### Registrar: 201 (repetir: 409)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login: guardar token
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Usuario actual
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar tareas
GET {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear: guardar id
# @name createTask
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Preparar la demo", "description": "Ensayar cada paso" }

### Obtener tarea creada
GET {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear inválida: 400
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### Actualizar
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }

### PATCH vacío: 400
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ID inválido: 400
GET {{base}}/tasks/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar solo la tarea creada: 204 (repetir: 404)
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Token alterado: 401
GET {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer no-es-un-jwt

### OpenAPI público
GET {{base}}/docs/openapi.json
